{"text":"永平三年十一月廿九日，比丘尼惠智爲七世父母、所生父母造釋加像一軀。願使託生西方妙樂國土，下生人間爲公主長者，永離三塗。又願身平安，遇與彌勒俱生蓮華樹下，三會説法。一切衆生，普同斯願。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"惠智","refId":null,"text":"惠智","start":14,"end":16},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋加","start":27,"end":29},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":35,"end":37},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"西方","refId":null,"text":"西方","start":37,"end":39},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"妙樂國土","refId":null,"text":"妙樂國土","start":39,"end":43},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三途","refId":null,"text":"三塗","start":56,"end":58},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":67,"end":69},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"生蓮華","start":70,"end":73},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華三會","refId":null,"text":"三會","start":76,"end":78},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":83,"end":85}]}